<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Publius Ostorius Scapula</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">d. 52</span> · <a href="/centuries/1st-century">1st century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Publius Ostorius Scapula was Roman governor of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/britain">Britain</a> from 47 to 52. He tried to disarm the tribes behind the frontier, provoking a revolt of the Iceni in 47, campaigned against the Deceangli and defeated <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/caratacus">Caratacus</a> in 51. Worn out by the resistance of the Silures, he died in office in 52.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/publius-ostorius-scapula.jpg" alt="Publius Ostorius Scapula" width="320" height="739" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Ad Meskens · CC BY-SA 3.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Roman_baths_ostorius_01.JPG" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
